# type(scope): subject
#
# type:    feat fix docs style refactor perf test build ci chore revert
# scope:   optional, lower case, e.g. (auth) (env) (make)
# subject: imperative, lower case, no full stop, at most 90 characters
#
# Then a blank line, then WHY this change — the diff already says what.
#
# No Co-authored-by line for an AI tool: the author is the developer, always.
